1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Fourth Episode
The Assassins
The Stormy Coffin Tower

15
00:01:53,699 --> 00:01:58,680
<i>Before today's episode, let's recap what happened up to last week.</i>

16
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:01,032
<i>When the King went missing,</i>

17
00:02:01,416 --> 00:02:05,200
<i>Prince Sapphire was set to succeed him and take the throne.</i>

18
00:02:06,109 --> 00:02:06,562
<i>However,</i>

19
00:02:06,866 --> 00:02:09,965
<i>tricked by the evil Duralumin and Nylon,</i>

20
00:02:09,989 --> 00:02:14,239
<i>the Queen accidentally let slip that Sapphire was actually a girl,</i>

21
00:02:14,263 --> 00:02:19,727
<i>resulting in them both being trapped on terrifying Coffin Island.</i>

22
00:02:22,850 --> 00:02:25,125
<i>With Sapphire out of the way, Duralumin began</i>

23
00:02:25,149 --> 00:02:27,880
<i>abusing his power, making the people suffer.</i>

24
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:29,985
<i>Upon learning this, Sapphire</i>

25
00:02:30,009 --> 00:02:32,899
<i>escaped through a secret passage shown by the mice, masked her face,</i>

26
00:02:32,923 --> 00:02:39,290
<i>and became the mysterious Ribbon Knight to defeat Duralumin's henchmen...</i>

27
00:02:39,315 --> 00:02:41,240
<i>...and rescue the suffering people.</i>

28
00:02:41,885 --> 00:02:43,760
<i>Meanwhile, Duralumin refuses to back down.</i>

29
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:47,732
<i>Suspecting that Ribbon Knight might actually be Sapphire,</i>

30
00:02:47,756 --> 00:02:50,660
<i>he sends invincible assassins to Coffin Island.</i>

31
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:53,900
<i>Now, Sapphire and the Queen's lives are in grave danger!</i>

32
00:02:54,344 --> 00:02:58,080
<i>And on that note, please sit back and enjoy today's episode.</i>

33
00:03:14,863 --> 00:03:16,915
I'll bash you, you damn mouse!

34
00:03:16,940 --> 00:03:17,779
Ouch!

35
00:03:39,351 --> 00:03:39,991
What?

36
00:03:40,015 --> 00:03:41,200
Little mouse? What is it?

37
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:48,540
What an interesting little mouse.

38
00:04:00,020 --> 00:04:01,020
What?

39
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:12,520
Assassins... They must be after our lives!

40
00:04:12,734 --> 00:04:14,593
Thank you for warning us, little mouse.

41
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:28,021
Sorry to keep you waiting. Mother, assassins are coming.

42
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,300
Assassins?

43
00:04:29,610 --> 00:04:31,360
They've definitely come to kill us.

44
00:04:31,545 --> 00:04:33,280
Whatever you do, don't open the door.

45
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:41,140
Sapphire, what are you...

46
00:04:41,790 --> 00:04:43,040
I'm going to drive those assassins away.

47
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:03,889
Now, Gama,

48
00:05:03,913 --> 00:05:06,940
lead the way. Where are the Prince and Queen's quarters?

49
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:07,580
Yes, sir.

50
00:05:14,186 --> 00:05:15,146
Sapphire.

51
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:21,920
It's this room.

52
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:24,280
Are you sure they're both inside?

53
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:29,780
As long as they're locked in tight, they don't do much unless they're working.

54
00:05:29,980 --> 00:05:30,540
All right.

55
00:05:33,590 --> 00:05:36,686
Fighting a woman and a kid feels a bit underwhelming.

56
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,593
Shut up!

57
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:38,693
Listen up.

58
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:44,020
I'll blast a hole in the door with this, then you fire a rocket right through it.

59
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:46,496
Okay.

60
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:50,420
The other three of you finish 'em off if they come at us.

61
00:05:51,140 --> 00:05:51,700
Got it?

62
00:05:51,985 --> 00:05:52,853
Let's do this!

63
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,340
Isn't this overkill?

64
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,513
Shut up!

65
00:06:10,350 --> 00:06:11,600
Sapphire hurry!

66
00:06:20,660 --> 00:06:21,820
Hey, you assassins!

67
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:23,420
Ribbon Knight!

68
00:06:23,473 --> 00:06:24,806
Where the hell did you get in?!

69
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:27,346
The Ribbon Knight can enter from anywhere!

70
00:06:27,665 --> 00:06:29,431
Anyone who lays a finger on the Queen and Princess Sapphire

71
00:06:29,455 --> 00:06:31,553
will have to answer to the Ribbon Knight!

72
00:06:31,660 --> 00:06:32,153
Come on!

73
00:07:09,990 --> 00:07:11,420
Got that, you goons!

74
00:07:11,710 --> 00:07:14,680
Don't you dare lay a finger on the Queen or Princess Sapphire ever again!

75
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:18,400
Wait... that kid, that figure... I've seen them somewhere before...

76
00:07:24,936 --> 00:07:26,467
Somewhere before...

77
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,926
Sapphire? It can't be...

78
00:07:32,610 --> 00:07:36,574
They look so much alike... But no way...

79
00:07:40,775 --> 00:07:41,775
Alright, that's it!

80
00:07:47,470 --> 00:07:49,620
It can't be... but they look so alike!

81
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,400
In any case, I've got to make sure!

82
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,913
Alright...

83
00:08:22,485 --> 00:08:24,060
Oh, Gama! You startled me!

84
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:25,940
Gama, I was so scared!

85
00:08:26,154 --> 00:08:29,280
A bunch of scary guys came and tried to kill us!

86
00:08:30,180 --> 00:08:33,760
But then someone called the Ribbon Knight saved us!

87
00:08:34,305 --> 00:08:36,820
Hey Gama, who is this Ribbon Knight anyway?

88
00:08:38,035 --> 00:08:41,279
Was I wrong? Still, they look so much alike...

89
00:08:43,829 --> 00:08:44,940
I can't just sit around!

90
00:08:45,215 --> 00:08:47,260
Duralumin must have sent those assassins!

91
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:49,660
I won't let him get away with this again!

92
00:08:49,845 --> 00:08:51,380
I'm going to teach him a real lesson!

93
00:08:58,733 --> 00:09:01,500
It's the Ribbon Knight!

94
00:09:07,609 --> 00:09:08,940
Open the gate!

95
00:09:10,429 --> 00:09:11,973
I have business with Duralumin!

96
00:09:13,530 --> 00:09:14,980
Open the gate!

97
00:09:15,385 --> 00:09:16,500
This is terrible!

98
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:17,120
This is terrible!

99
00:09:17,121 --> 00:09:18,121
This is terrible!

100
00:09:18,310 --> 00:09:19,453
This is terrible!

101
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,606
This is terrible!

102
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,333
This is terrible!

103
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:27,406
Most terrible news!

104
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,800
Most terrible news, my lord!

105
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:30,393
What on earth is going on?

106
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:33,000
The Ribbon Knight is trying to storm the castle!

107
00:09:33,478 --> 00:09:33,960
Fool!

108
00:09:33,985 --> 00:09:34,960
Don't let her in!

109
00:09:35,109 --> 00:09:36,220
Drive her back and kill her!

110
00:09:36,245 --> 00:09:37,973
Don't let her leave alive!

111
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,240
Alright, Duralumin!

112
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:46,279
I'm returning the assassins you sent to the Coffin Tower!

113
00:09:48,085 --> 00:09:48,900
No!

114
00:09:48,901 --> 00:09:50,001
Kill him!

115
00:09:50,060 --> 00:09:50,746
Take that!

116
00:09:55,749 --> 00:09:57,433
What's wrong, Your Grace?

117
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:02,140
How about that?!

118
00:10:02,205 --> 00:10:03,600
How does your idiot henchman taste?

119
00:10:03,893 --> 00:10:04,746
Take that!

120
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:12,053
Here's another!

121
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:18,500
Take that!

122
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,600
Duralumin!

123
00:10:31,755 --> 00:10:33,480
The Knight of the Ribbon appears wherever you go!

124
00:10:33,675 --> 00:10:35,340
And I'll fight you to the very end!

125
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,420
Take that!

126
00:10:40,899 --> 00:10:43,060
One of these days, I'll definitely kill you!

127
00:10:43,130 --> 00:10:44,380
Prepare yourself!

128
00:11:12,085 --> 00:11:13,085
Barkeep!

129
00:11:13,189 --> 00:11:14,860
Keep the booze coming!

130
00:11:15,579 --> 00:11:20,277
But you aren't going to pay me...

131
00:11:20,301 --> 00:11:21,461
What did you say?!

132
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,026
Pay you?!

133
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:23,700
Yes!

134
00:11:24,015 --> 00:11:24,475
You bastard!

135
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,240
I'll say it again!

136
00:11:26,747 --> 00:11:29,400
We're Lord Duralumin's royal guard!

137
00:11:29,425 --> 00:11:30,620
Help!

138
00:11:31,060 --> 00:11:32,060
No way, old man!

139
00:11:32,125 --> 00:11:35,980
Bring us booze, or we'll feed your kid to your own dog!

140
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:38,260
Mercy, please!

141
00:11:38,380 --> 00:11:39,740
Then hurry up and bring it!

142
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:41,500
You bastard!

143
00:11:41,735 --> 00:11:43,766
You're dog food!

144
00:11:46,184 --> 00:11:47,626
You soldiers of Duralumin!

145
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,553
The Ribbon Knight is going to knock you senseless!

146
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:58,306
Yeah! The Ribbon Knight is so cool!

147
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:22,903
Oh, Ribbon Knight...

148
00:12:22,933 --> 00:12:24,626
What on earth did those men do?

149
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:29,553
They're being sent to the quarry just for singing the Ribbon Knight's song.

150
00:12:29,859 --> 00:12:31,173
The Ribbon Knight song?

151
00:12:31,415 --> 00:12:32,440
It's all the rage right now.

152
00:12:32,570 --> 00:12:35,460
Ribbon, ribbon, Ribbon Knight is the champion!

153
00:12:37,750 --> 00:12:39,780
Wait!

154
00:12:40,355 --> 00:12:42,140
Wait!

155
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:43,746
It's the Ribbon Knight!

156
00:12:56,140 --> 00:13:00,440
♪ ribbon no kishi wa champion ♪
Ribbon Knight is the champion!

157
00:13:01,955 --> 00:13:06,160
♪ ribbon no kishi wa champion ♪
Ribbon Knight is the champion!

158
00:13:08,999 --> 00:13:11,146
Did the Ribbon Knight help the prisoners escape?

159
00:13:11,315 --> 00:13:14,820
He's so elusive—no telling when or where he'll show up.

160
00:13:15,099 --> 00:13:19,089
Ribbon Knight is the champion. Pretty cool, huh?

161
00:13:19,114 --> 00:13:20,460
You fool!

162
00:13:23,096 --> 00:13:24,686
Curse that Ribbon Knight!

163
00:13:27,839 --> 00:13:30,200
This plan is guaranteed to catch the Ribbon Knight.

164
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:32,806
He's a hit with the kids.

165
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:34,479
So we capture a kid...

166
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:36,740
...and he's bound to come to the rescue.

167
00:13:38,130 --> 00:13:39,380
That's where we set our trap.

168
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,820
He'll fall for it for sure!

169
00:13:42,226 --> 00:13:47,260
♪ ribbon no kishi wa champion ♪
Ribbon Knight is the champion!

170
00:13:48,359 --> 00:13:53,560
♪ Zuron, kingan, rairon, sansan, janpu! ♪
-

171
00:13:54,389 --> 00:13:55,940
♪ jamporin ♪
Jump and bounce!

172
00:13:56,620 --> 00:14:01,260
♪ ribbon no kishi wa champion ♪
Ribbon Knight is the champion!

173
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:03,986
♪ Zuron, king... ♪
-

174
00:14:05,385 --> 00:14:07,292
Help!

175
00:14:10,439 --> 00:14:12,481
Here you go. It's delicious juice.

176
00:14:12,505 --> 00:14:13,033
Thank you.

177
00:14:13,070 --> 00:14:14,070
We've got trouble!

178
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,300
Damn it!

179
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:19,380
That Ribbon Knight!

180
00:14:19,465 --> 00:14:21,180
This time, he's going straight to the grave!

181
00:14:48,226 --> 00:14:48,853
Cry!

182
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:49,346
Cry!

183
00:14:49,444 --> 00:14:51,540
Cry, and the Ribbon Knight will come to rescue you!

184
00:14:52,944 --> 00:14:54,440
Once he comes, he's ours.

185
00:14:54,780 --> 00:14:57,374
When he enters the plaza, rain cannons, rockets,

186
00:14:57,398 --> 00:15:00,080
and arrows on him and finish him off!

187
00:15:07,020 --> 00:15:08,460
Hasn't he shown up yet?

188
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:15,100
What's wrong?

189
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:16,980
Did the Ribbon Knight chicken out?

190
00:15:28,895 --> 00:15:30,720
That Ribbon Knight!

191
00:15:34,185 --> 00:15:36,073
Is she too scared?

192
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:44,340
Cry!

193
00:15:44,393 --> 00:15:44,735
Cry!

194
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:45,320
Cry harder!

195
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:47,020
If you cry, the Ribbon Knight...

196
00:15:51,829 --> 00:15:53,066
She came from the sky!

197
00:16:30,349 --> 00:16:31,735
No, it's burning! Water, water!

198
00:16:32,050 --> 00:16:33,646
Throw it on!

199
00:16:33,929 --> 00:16:35,406
Not on me!

200
00:16:42,965 --> 00:16:44,131
He got us!

201
00:16:45,380 --> 00:16:47,700
She's coming at us like crazy!

202
00:16:48,629 --> 00:16:50,620
Come on, everyone, hurry home!

203
00:16:52,019 --> 00:16:53,753
Thank you, Ribbon Knight!

204
00:16:54,260 --> 00:16:55,260
Be careful!

205
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:57,720
Don't get caught this time!

206
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,914
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

207
00:17:03,938 --> 00:17:04,498
Hey!

208
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:06,186
This is no time to cry!

209
00:17:06,740 --> 00:17:07,134
Hey!

210
00:17:07,159 --> 00:17:08,440
I know the Ribbon Knight's hideout!

211
00:17:08,441 --> 00:17:09,060
I mean, I know where the Ribbon Knight is!

212
00:17:09,061 --> 00:17:09,895
Ribbon Knight?

213
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,046
Now isn't the time for that...

214
00:17:13,279 --> 00:17:15,020
Well, well, what a lovely young lady!

215
00:17:15,259 --> 00:17:17,180
You're looking for Ribbon Knight?

216
00:17:18,599 --> 00:17:19,415
That's right!

217
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:19,839
That jerk!

218
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:20,814
Where is he?

219
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:22,099
I know!

220
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:22,806
Really?

221
00:17:22,839 --> 00:17:23,280
Tell me!

222
00:17:23,339 --> 00:17:24,873
Lovely lady, please!

223
00:17:25,159 --> 00:17:29,080
I'm planning to tell Grand Duke Duralumin!

224
00:17:29,404 --> 00:17:32,080
I was just SO dying to meet Lord Bushy-Eyebrows!

225
00:17:32,106 --> 00:17:33,920
Forget that guy, why not me?

226
00:17:35,269 --> 00:17:37,899
I still think Lord Bushy-Eyebrows is way dreamier!

227
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:39,200
Is that so!

228
00:17:39,313 --> 00:17:39,840
Fine then!

229
00:17:39,999 --> 00:17:42,000
Then allow me to escort you to the castle!

230
00:17:57,899 --> 00:17:59,820
Now, wait here, young lady!

231
00:18:00,014 --> 00:18:02,460
Grand Duke Duralumin will be arriving shortly!

232
00:18:03,059 --> 00:18:04,766
Yes, I'll wait right here like this!

233
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:05,740
Splendid!

234
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,900
What a polite young lady!

235
00:18:08,099 --> 00:18:09,900
Now, stay like that for a while!

236
00:18:19,039 --> 00:18:22,260
So you know where the Ribbon Knight is?

237
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:23,293
Yes!

238
00:18:25,460 --> 00:18:26,166
Where is he?

239
00:18:26,220 --> 00:18:27,940
Where is the Ribbon Knight?

240
00:18:27,980 --> 00:18:28,320
Where is he?

241
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,140
Where is the Ribbon Knight?

242
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:32,760
I wanted to meet the Ribbon Knight because he's so dashing...

243
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:35,760
I asked you where the Ribbon Knight is!

244
00:18:36,153 --> 00:18:37,866
Look up and answer me!

245
00:18:39,260 --> 00:18:39,946
Right here!

246
00:18:40,780 --> 00:18:42,466
The Ribbon Knight is right here!

247
00:18:49,869 --> 00:18:52,215
Someone capture the Ribbon Knight!

248
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,240
Don't move!

249
00:18:53,929 --> 00:18:56,760
I promised the Ribbon Knight would show up at the castle!

250
00:18:56,994 --> 00:18:58,346
And here I am, just as promised!

251
00:18:58,520 --> 00:18:59,520
Don't move!

252
00:19:00,869 --> 00:19:01,869
I'll be taking this!

253
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:05,593
Get the crown back!

254
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:31,180
You brainless, bumbling idiot!

255
00:19:31,389 --> 00:19:34,206
What were you thinking, bringing the Ribbon Knight right to us?!

256
00:19:34,374 --> 00:19:38,020
I'm so mad I could burst!

257
00:19:38,140 --> 00:19:39,140
I'm furious!

258
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,440
Sapphire!

259
00:19:58,620 --> 00:19:59,859
She's really late today...

260
00:20:02,246 --> 00:20:03,273
It's Gama!

261
00:20:06,813 --> 00:20:07,860
Hello!

262
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:08,380
Open up!

263
00:20:08,706 --> 00:20:09,320
Hold on!

264
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:10,794
Hold on, you say?!

265
00:20:10,819 --> 00:20:12,700
It's time for Sapphire to fetch water!

266
00:20:12,969 --> 00:20:14,933
What happened to Sapphire?!

267
00:20:15,220 --> 00:20:16,060
Wait a minute!

268
00:20:16,190 --> 00:20:17,190
Please wait!

269
00:20:17,225 --> 00:20:18,225
No way!

270
00:20:18,714 --> 00:20:20,120
You're acting suspicious!

271
00:20:22,980 --> 00:20:23,740
She's not here!

272
00:20:23,806 --> 00:20:24,575
Damn it!

273
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:25,600
I knew it!

274
00:20:25,934 --> 00:20:28,253
Sapphire is the Ribbon Knight!

275
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:29,360
That's not true!

276
00:20:29,435 --> 00:20:30,520
Like hell it isn't!

277
00:20:30,985 --> 00:20:31,985
Damn it!

278
00:20:32,129 --> 00:20:35,666
You know what happens if she escapes the Coffin Tower!

279
00:20:36,069 --> 00:20:38,380
The Queen gets tied up right along with her!

280
00:20:39,024 --> 00:20:41,140
Prepare yourself!

281
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:45,160
That's not true!

282
00:20:45,719 --> 00:20:50,260
I'm sure Sapphire is fetching water right now!

283
00:20:50,409 --> 00:20:51,720
Don't give me that nonsense!

284
00:20:52,094 --> 00:20:53,700
All right, let's go check!

285
00:20:54,479 --> 00:20:57,000
If she's not there, the Queen gets this!

286
00:21:02,429 --> 00:21:04,960
Sapphire, we're finished!

287
00:21:21,173 --> 00:21:25,086
♪ Sonochi harema ga... ♪
One of these days...

288
00:21:25,340 --> 00:21:26,640
Hey! Hey! Hey!

289
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:28,553
Where have you been?

290
00:21:28,839 --> 00:21:31,728
Earlier, Gama, You forgot to lock the door,

291
00:21:31,752 --> 00:21:34,440
so I snuck out to play with the mice in the attic.

292
00:21:34,799 --> 00:21:37,000
But I still started fetching water right on time!

293
00:21:37,245 --> 00:21:38,073
Shut up!

294
00:21:38,189 --> 00:21:39,560
You acted on your own!

295
00:21:40,499 --> 00:21:41,600
Don't laugh!

296
00:21:42,619 --> 00:21:44,593
Still, something isn't right...

297
00:21:44,860 --> 00:21:47,280
I feel like I'm being duped...

298
00:22:05,580 --> 00:22:06,920
Curse that Ribbon Knight!

299
00:22:07,140 --> 00:22:08,140
Her wit!

300
00:22:08,585 --> 00:22:09,380
Her courage!

301
00:22:09,405 --> 00:22:10,000
Her look!

302
00:22:10,060 --> 00:22:11,060
Her voice!

303
00:22:11,620 --> 00:22:12,620
Damn it!

304
00:22:12,720 --> 00:22:15,820
She's just one girl! She should be easy to crush!

305
00:22:16,639 --> 00:22:19,393
She drove off the assassin and didn't fall for the trap!

306
00:22:23,459 --> 00:22:23,660
No... wait!

307
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:25,060
I have a great idea!

308
00:22:25,919 --> 00:22:28,820
I'm sick of hearing about your "great ideas"!

309
00:22:28,985 --> 00:22:29,985
No, no, no!

310
00:22:30,169 --> 00:22:31,900
This is the absolute best idea!

311
00:22:32,589 --> 00:22:33,720
Luckily, it's storming outside!

312
00:22:34,009 --> 00:22:35,495
We can't let this chance slip by...

313
00:22:36,566 --> 00:22:38,660
It's better to be patient than send a whole crowd of assassins!

314
00:22:38,869 --> 00:22:40,460
We'll have it done quietly!

315
00:23:00,755 --> 00:23:01,540
What?

316
00:23:01,704 --> 00:23:04,180
<i>Tonight's storm is perfect!</i>

317
00:23:05,379 --> 00:23:07,800
<i>Kill Sapphire and the Queen tonight!</i>

318
00:23:07,959 --> 00:23:11,000
<i>I have sent the reward with the messenger, Lord Nylon!</i>

319
00:23:18,014 --> 00:23:19,080
Kill both of them!

320
00:23:35,799 --> 00:23:38,559
I don't really feel like killing a girl, but...

321
00:23:50,580 --> 00:23:51,580
Gama!

322
00:23:51,585 --> 00:23:52,585
Sapphire!

323
00:23:52,749 --> 00:23:54,973
Where do you think you're going at this hour?

324
00:23:56,859 --> 00:23:59,567
I'm... nowhere... um...

325
00:23:59,591 --> 00:24:02,560
You were looking for an escape hole, weren't you?

326
00:24:03,044 --> 00:24:06,420
Alright, if you want out so bad, I'll let you out!

327
00:24:07,589 --> 00:24:09,520
Though you won't leave alive!

328
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:11,500
Gama!

329
00:24:11,560 --> 00:24:12,560
What are you doing?!

330
00:24:34,340 --> 00:24:37,960
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

331
00:24:37,961 --> 00:24:41,321
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

332
00:24:41,322 --> 00:24:45,092
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

333
00:24:45,093 --> 00:24:48,254
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

334
00:24:48,255 --> 00:24:52,068
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

335
00:24:52,069 --> 00:24:55,365
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

336
00:24:55,366 --> 00:24:59,371
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

337
00:24:59,372 --> 00:25:02,810
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

338
00:25:02,811 --> 00:25:06,431
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

339
00:25:06,432 --> 00:25:09,792
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

340
00:25:09,793 --> 00:25:13,563
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

